@startuml CU-15
actor "Staff (caja)" as Staff
boundary "«UI» Angular / API clients" as UI
control "«Controller» API /payments" as Ctrl
entity "«Service» PaymentService (domain)" as Svc
entity "«Adapter» MockGateway / PagosNetGateway" as Gtw
entity "«Model» Payment / Sale" as Model

Staff -> UI : 1: iniciar cobro
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /payments/initiate
Ctrl -> Svc : 3: pay(order_reference, amount)
Svc -> Gtw : 4: create_payment(request)
Gtw --> Svc : 5: PaymentResult
Svc --> Ctrl : 6: referencia
Ctrl -> Model : 7: crear Payment
Ctrl --> UI : 8: PaymentRead
UI --> Staff : 9: referencia y estado

Staff -> UI : 10: confirmar cobro
UI -> Ctrl : 11: POST /payments/confirm
Ctrl -> Svc : 12: status(reference)
Svc -> Gtw : 13: get_status(reference)
Gtw --> Svc : 14: COMPLETED/DECLINED
Svc --> Ctrl : 15: estado
Ctrl -> Model : 16: venta PAID + paid_at
Ctrl --> UI : 17: {reference, status}

Staff -> UI : 18: reembolso
UI -> Ctrl : 19: POST /payments/refund
Ctrl -> Svc : 20: refund(reference)
Svc -> Gtw : 21: refund(reference)
Gtw --> Svc : 22: REFUNDED
Ctrl -> Model : 23: venta REFUNDED
Ctrl --> UI : 24: {reference, status}

@enduml